usage: final_script.py [-h] [--url URL] [--todo TODO]

Select dark theme, add one todo and mark its checkbox complete.

options:
  -h, --help   show this help message and exit
  --url URL    Allowlisted loopback fixture URL. Default:
               http://127.0.0.1:57186/healthy.
  --todo TODO  Nonempty todo text entered once. Default: milk.
